{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00463",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.76,
      "end_seconds": 4.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. Where would you like me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.29,
      "end_seconds": 8.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.28,
      "end_seconds": 14.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "I've been feeling very thirsty."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.24,
      "end_seconds": 19.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.02,
      "end_seconds": 25.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I'm on Glycomet, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.51,
      "end_seconds": 28.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.63,
      "end_seconds": 33.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "It's, It's 500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.48,
      "end_seconds": 36.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.46,
      "end_seconds": 40.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "About... well, about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.54,
      "end_seconds": 41.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.8,
      "end_seconds": 44.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Would you call it mild or bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.65,
      "end_seconds": 56.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "It feels mild to me. Hmm, I was passing urine a lot at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.79,
      "end_seconds": 62.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "A few quick ones: chest pain, weight loss or abdominal pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.24,
      "end_seconds": 67.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Hmm, uh, nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.63,
      "end_seconds": 72.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "And foot sores, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.13,
      "end_seconds": 78.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Hmm, no, I haven't had any foot sores."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.95,
      "end_seconds": 82.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.57,
      "end_seconds": 91.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Well, you know, bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.27,
      "end_seconds": 96.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.96,
      "end_seconds": 100.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.1,
      "end_seconds": 117.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.5,
      "end_seconds": 131.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "So, you know, I have diabetes, for two years. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.51,
      "end_seconds": 138.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Okay, I can see diabetes in your file as well. Alright, any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.43,
      "end_seconds": 143.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.77,
      "end_seconds": 147.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Any sport or activity?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.38,
      "end_seconds": 152.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I play badminton on Sundays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.18,
      "end_seconds": 157.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "And what do you usually eat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.01,
      "end_seconds": 161.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Mostly home-cooked food, rice and vegetables."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.38,
      "end_seconds": 165.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.15,
      "end_seconds": 176.96,
      "duration_seconds": 10.81,
      "text": "Right, just a knee arthroscopy, three years ago. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.89,
      "end_seconds": 182.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.17,
      "end_seconds": 187.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Right, I don't have any known medication allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.6,
      "end_seconds": 191.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Let's do your observations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.9,
      "end_seconds": 205.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.77,
      "end_seconds": 241.19,
      "duration_seconds": 15.42,
      "text": "Okay: height 170 centimetres, BMI works out to 20.4, respiratory rate 17, pulse is 73 beats a minute, SpO2 97 percent on room air, pressure 148 over 104, weight 59 kilos, temp 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.96,
      "end_seconds": 243.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.94,
      "end_seconds": 248.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.63,
      "end_seconds": 266.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "Listening to the whole story, the most likely explanation is diabetes that isn't well controlled."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.57,
      "end_seconds": 290.69,
      "duration_seconds": 14.12,
      "text": "I'm sending you for an HbA1c because of diabetes control. I'm sending you for kidney function tests because of diabetes. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.55,
      "end_seconds": 295.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Well, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.94,
      "end_seconds": 304.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is glimepiride, 1 milligrams, before breakfast, until we review. It's for blood sugar control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.67,
      "end_seconds": 308.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "That's easy enough to remember."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.83,
      "end_seconds": 325.08,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "Check your feet every day, and never walk barefoot. I think a dietitian should see you too. See me again after the results are back. Okay, ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.86,
      "end_seconds": 329.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Um, nothing more from me, thanks."
    }
  ]
}